<title>UK: Halifax offers car insurance with Churchill.</title>
<headline>Halifax offers car insurance with Churchill.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Halifax Building Society on Monday launched its own car insurance product underwritten by Churchill Insurance Company.</p>
<p>&quot;Motor insurance has been one of the gaps in our product range which we have been keen to fill,&quot; said Halifax chief executive Mike Blackburn in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
